{"rationale":"The evidence shows service account svc.app@eproc.test (database role app_service) systematically paginated through all rows of public.employees selecting every sensitive column (salary, national_id, bank_account), then executed COPY TO STDOUT to export those columns in bulk. This occurred between 02:40–03:05 UTC, well outside the principal's 08:00–17:00 baseline. The app_service role has SELECT on the base employees table but the application should use the masked view employees_public; direct access to sensitive columns is not required for procurement operations. The remediation terminates any remaining backends from this session, preserves audit evidence in a quarantine table, revokes SELECT on the base employees table from app_service, and grants SELECT on the masked view employees_public so legitimate non-sensitive queries continue to work. This is scoped to the implicated object (public.employees) and role (app_service) without locking the Teleport principal, which would take down the entire procurement application.","language":"sql","script":"-- 1. Terminate any backends still open for this service account from the implicated source
SELECT pg_terminate_backend(pid)
FROM pg_stat_activity
WHERE usename = 'app_service'
  AND client_addr = '10.20.1.10'::inet
  AND pid <> pg_backend_pid();

-- 2. Preserve forensic evidence in a quarantine table (audit_log is not modified)
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.quarantine_alrt0011 AS
SELECT *
FROM public.audit_log
WHERE session_id = 'b86fb472-b58a-46fd-bfe3-a5beb5c50a59';

-- 3. Revoke access to the base employees table (contains salary, national_id, bank_account)
REVOKE SELECT ON public.employees FROM app_service;

-- 4. Ensure app_service retains access to the masked view for non-sensitive employee data
GRANT SELECT ON public.employees_public TO app_service;
","rollback":"-- Restore SELECT on base employees table to app_service
GRANT SELECT ON public.employees TO app_service;

-- Remove the quarantine evidence table (only if no longer needed)
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS public.quarantine_alrt0011;
","confidence":"high"}

